            "detailed_description": "Brawlerz Arena is a fast paced Arena-Combat game, putting players in charge of insane nitrous-infused vehicles with everything a car needs - weapons &amp; explosives! Experience team combat with deathmatch and soccer game modes in high detailed combat arenas. Play online or play split-screen (why not both?).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Features Include</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Addictive 8-player online action<br></li><li> Up to 4 players can play per screen (split screen) in both offline &amp; online games<br></li><li> Old school 2, 3, and 4 player split-screen mode for offline or online play<br></li><li> Soccer &amp; deathmatch game modes<br></li><li> Bots that work in all game modes<br></li><li> No racing, why race when you have guns?</li></ul>",
