                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really fun game, if you like rocket league or fast paced action games you should get this. You can play with bots or online. Although there is not many players online now you can still have a fun time with the bots! There are 3 gamemodes: Soccer, Deathmatch and capture the flag. Each one is really fun! You can choose from different cars and weapons to mach your play style.\n\nPros:\n1: Different gamemodes\n2:Bots, splitscreen or online\n3: fast paced and action packed game\n4: Really good looking\n5: customization!\n\nCons:\n1: Bugs (as to be expected in early access)\n2: The bots need to be worked on\n\nOverall it is a great game, I recommend this game! Dont get this game if you are expecting it to be perfect, but the devs are open to feedback!",
